        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n4" value="External host: host_en / host_we / host_addr[31:0] / host_wdata[31:0]&#10;Return: host_ready / host_rdata[31:0]. Hold request until ACK; deassert enable between transactions.&#10;Status: running / ready / error / overflow_out. Debug: pc_debug[8:0] / instr_debug[12:0].&#10;Clock/reset: clk / rst_n. This is an internal request/acknowledge interface; AXI/APB are not implemented." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=24;shadow=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="270" width="1540" height="180" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n5" value="Block Functions &amp; Interfaces&#10;llm_soc: Host frontend and autonomous graph; parent muxes, operand caches, scaling, softmax/V pass,&#10;vector writes and token selection.&#10;  TOP&#10;  Parameters: USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=0, PERF_COUNTERS=0, ENABLE_DEBUG_INDEX=0, ATTN_DIV_LANES=4,&#10;SIGMOID_LANES=4&#10;Source: llm_soc.sv:3&#10;&#10;Configuration: USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=0, ATTN_DIV_LANES=4, SIGMOID_LANES=4.&#10;PERF_COUNTERS=0 and ENABLE_DEBUG_INDEX=0. Other configurations require a separate expansion.&#10;USE_SHARED=1: normalizer lane zero is connected to top u_div; only lanes 1, 2, 3 are children.&#10;Packages are source context, not instances. Generate scopes are annotations, not modules.&#10;Alternate memory hierarchy: see rtl_hierarchy_portable.drawio. Quartus is a demonstration backend." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=24;shadow=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="480" width="1700" height="414" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
