        <mxCell id="n664" value="Block Functions &amp; Interfaces&#10;llm_parameter_ram: Eight 32-bit lanes; compute row read / valid, host lane read and post-commit write&#10;acknowledgement.&#10;  TOP.u_parameters&#10;  Role: Parameter image: 24576 x 256 bits; host accesses 32-bit lanes, compute reads complete rows.&#10;  Parameters: ADDR_W=15, DEPTH=24576, USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=0&#10;Source: llm_parameter_ram.sv:5&#10;&#10;pipelined_word_ram: Registered SRAM adapter; rd_en/address -&gt; data/valid; wr_en/address/data -&gt;&#10;wr_valid after commit.&#10;  TOP.u_parameters.g_ram_lane[0:7].u_storage (8 instances; inclusive ranges)&#10;  Parameters: WIDTH=32, ROWS=24576, ADDR_W=15, USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=0&#10;  TOP.u_vectors.g_bank[0:31].u_storage (32 instances; inclusive ranges)&#10;  Parameters: WIDTH=24, ROWS=96, ADDR_W=7, USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=0&#10;  TOP.u_cache.g_bank[0:31].u_storage (32 instances; inclusive ranges)&#10;  Parameters: WIDTH=24, ROWS=4096, ADDR_W=12, USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=0&#10;Source: pipelined_word_ram.sv:4&#10;&#10;llm_bank_ram: Thirty-two S24 banks; rd_en/rd_addr -&gt; rd_data/rd_valid; masked writes and wr_busy&#10;drain.&#10;  TOP.u_vectors&#10;  Role: Intermediate vector workspace: 96 x 768 bits; v_address_q/v_data/v_valid and masked&#10;write_vector_q.&#10;  Parameters: LANES=32, WIDTH=24, ROWS=96, ADDR_W=7, USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=0&#10;  TOP.u_cache&#10;  Role: Causal K/V storage: 4096 x 768 bits; attention or parent k_read_address, k_data/k_valid and&#10;cache writes.&#10;  Parameters: LANES=32, WIDTH=24, ROWS=4096, ADDR_W=12, USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=0&#10;Source: llm_bank_ram.sv:5&#10;&#10;llm_math: STREAMING=1, 32 S24xS32 lanes; accept E0, product_valid E3, sum_valid E8, legacy done E9.&#10;  TOP.u_math&#10;  Parameters: STREAMING=1&#10;Source: llm_math.sv:5&#10;&#10;logic_mul: Combinational bit products and carry-save reduction; a/b -&gt; product. No runtime multiply&#10;operator.&#10;  TOP.u_math.g_mul_lane[0:31].g_byte[0:3].u_mul (128 instances; inclusive ranges)&#10;  Parameters: A_W=24, B_W=8, OUT_W=33, SIGNED_A=1&#10;  TOP.u_attention_engine.u_scale&#10;  Parameters: A_W=39, B_W=14, OUT_W=55, SIGNED_A=1, SIGNED_B=0&#10;  TOP.g_sigmoid[0:3].u_sig.u_bit_mul (4 instances; inclusive ranges)&#10;  Parameters: A_W=24, B_W=10, OUT_W=34, SIGNED_A=0, SIGNED_B=0&#10;Source: logic_mul.sv:4&#10;&#10;llm_attention_normalize: Eight four-lane batches; lane zero shared at top, three private dividers;&#10;RNE/sign/clamp -&gt; vector/done.&#10;  TOP.u_attention_normalize&#10;  Parameters: DIV_LANES=4, USE_SHARED=1&#10;Source: llm_attention_normalize.sv:3&#10;&#10;div: Unsigned restoring shift/subtract divider: start/numerator/denominator -&gt;&#10;busy/done/quotient/remainder.&#10;  TOP.u_attention_normalize.g_divider[1:3].g_private.u_div (3 instances; inclusive ranges)&#10;  Parameters: NUM_W=64, DEN_W=32&#10;Source: div.sv:3&#10;&#10;llm_attention_engine: Causal K reads and parent math issue; rounded/scaled QK scores, score array,&#10;maximum and done.&#10;  TOP.u_attention_engine&#10;Source: llm_attention_engine.sv:4&#10;&#10;llm_linear_engine: Two-word parameter prefetch, ternary dot issue, S39 accumulation; start/ready,&#10;done/fault and cancellation drain.&#10;  TOP.u_linear_engine&#10;Source: llm_linear_engine.sv:3&#10;&#10;ternary_dot32: 32 ternary selectors; four registered stages; valid_i -&gt; valid_o/sum_o/reserved_o.&#10;  TOP.u_linear_engine.u_dot&#10;Source: ternary_dot32.sv:3&#10;&#10;sigmoid: start/x_raw/frac_bits -&gt; y_raw/busy/done; one table lookup and registered interpolation.&#10;  TOP.g_sigmoid[0:3].u_sig (4 instances; inclusive ranges)&#10;Source: sigmoid.sv:2&#10;&#10;sigmoid_sample: Combinational 257-entry sigmoid table: index U9 -&gt; value U16.&#10;  TOP.g_sigmoid[0:3].u_sig.u_lookup (4 instances; inclusive ranges)&#10;Source: sigmoid_lut.svh:3&#10;&#10;Configuration: USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=0, ATTN_DIV_LANES=4, SIGMOID_LANES=4.&#10;PERF_COUNTERS=0 and ENABLE_DEBUG_INDEX=0. Other configurations require a separate expansion.&#10;USE_SHARED=1: normalizer lane zero is connected to top u_div; only lanes 1, 2, 3 are children.&#10;Packages are source context, not instances. Generate scopes are annotations, not modules.&#10;Alternate memory hierarchy: see rtl_hierarchy_portable.drawio. Quartus is a demonstration backend." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=24;shadow=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="13130" width="1700" height="2544" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
